.TH MERMAN-CLI 1 2026-08-15 "Merman 0.8.0-alpha.5" "Merman CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
merman\-cli \- Headless Mermaid CLI with parse, analysis, and optional rendering capabilities.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmerman\-cli\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Headless Mermaid CLI with parse, analysis, and optional rendering capabilities.
.PP
The commands and formats shown below are exactly those compiled into this artifact. Use `capabilities \-\-json` for the machine\-readable capability contract.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
merman\-cli\-render(1)
Render one Mermaid diagram with Merman\*(Aqs native interface
.TP
merman\-cli\-batch(1)
Render every Mermaid diagram in one Markdown document
.TP
merman\-cli\-lint(1)
Analyze Mermaid source and print diagnostics JSON or text
.TP
merman\-cli\-fix(1)
Apply non\-conflicting diagnostics fixes to Mermaid or Markdown source
.TP
merman\-cli\-lint\-rules(1)
List lint rule metadata
.TP
merman\-cli\-mmdc(1)
Render through the pinned mmdc\-compatible interface
.TP
merman\-cli\-rustdoc(1)
Build or check committed static Mermaid fragments for Rustdoc
.TP
merman\-cli\-detect(1)
Detect the Mermaid diagram type
.TP
merman\-cli\-parse(1)
Parse Mermaid source and print the semantic JSON model
.TP
merman\-cli\-layout(1)
Parse and layout Mermaid source, then print layout JSON
.TP
merman\-cli\-capabilities(1)
Print the compiled capabilities from the canonical capability descriptor
.TP
merman\-cli\-completion(1)
Generate shell completion scripts
.SH VERSION
v0.8.0\-alpha.5
